WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.197
Emmy and Oliver were excited about the art show.

2
00:00:05.198 --> 00:00:08.627
It was at school.

3
00:00:08.628 --> 00:00:14.485
"I can't wait to show you my painting," Oliver said.

4
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:19.417
"I made a picture of a cow."

5
00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:23.127
"I'm sure it's a fine cow," Dad said.

6
00:00:23.128 --> 00:00:27.378
"I can't wait to show you my painting," Emmy said.

7
00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:30.580
"It's a picture of me."

8
00:00:30.581 --> 00:00:36.193
"I'm sure it looks just like you," Mom said.

9
00:00:36.194 --> 00:00:40.361
"I don't have a painting in the show," Harry said.

10
00:00:40.362 --> 00:00:44.900
"Oh, I'm sure you do," Aunt Judy said.

11
00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:51.144
"Every kid has something in the art show."

12
00:00:51.145 --> 00:00:55.503
Later the family went to the art show.

13
00:00:55.504 --> 00:00:59.691
They found Oliver's painting.

14
00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:03.960
"What a wonderful cow!" Dad said.

15
00:01:03.961 --> 00:01:08.544
"It looks happy in that field."

16
00:01:08.545 --> 00:01:16.463
Next they found Emmy's painting.

17
00:01:16.464 --> 00:01:21.422
"You're wearing your purple dress," Mom said.

18
00:01:21.423 --> 00:01:25.346
"That's one of my favorites."

19
00:01:25.347 --> 00:01:30.544
The Carters looked at all the paintings in Harry's grade.

20
00:01:30.545 --> 00:01:34.417
They looked at all the paintings in the show.

21
00:01:34.418 --> 00:01:37.761
But they couldn't find one by Harry.

22
00:01:37.762 --> 00:01:42.122
"Harry, I guess you're right," Aunt Judy said.

23
00:01:42.123 --> 00:01:46.949
"You don't have a painting in the show."

24
00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:53.835
Harry started to laugh. "That's because . . ."

25
00:01:53.836 --> 00:01:58.232
He pointed to a table.

26
00:01:58.233 --> 00:02:04.371
"You have a clay pot in the show!" Emmy said.

27
00:02:04.372 --> 00:02:10.942
The Carters walked over to the table.

28
00:02:10.943 --> 00:02:14.546
"Wow, Harry!" Dad said.

29
00:02:14.547 --> 00:02:19.111
"You won a prize!"

